  "question": {
    "text": "A tuning fork having a frequency of <math><mtext>170 Hz</mtext></math> is vibrating just above a cylindrical tube. The height of the tube is <math><mtext>110 cm</mtext></math>. Water is slowly poured in it. What is the minimum height&nbsp;(in <math><mtext>cm</mtext></math>) of water column required for resonance to occur? (Velocity of sound in air = <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mtext>340 m&nbsp;s</mtext><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math>)",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "60",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">λ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math><br /><br />Resonance will occur at <math><mfrac><mrow><mi>λ</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>λ</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mfrac><mrow><mn>5</mn><mi>λ</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mn>50</mn><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mn>150</mn><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mn>250</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math><br /><br />Minimum height of water <math><mo>=</mo><mn>110</mn><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>λ</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>110</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>50</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>60</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math>",
    "image": null
  },
